#: src/Privacy/Privacy.php:32
msgid "Community interactions, follows, drafts, preferences and messages are stored on this site. Search analytics store aggregate counts rather than raw questions. Optional external AI sends redacted questions and public discussion excerpts to the configured provider. Restricted discussions are excluded. Public media URLs remain public even if a discussion later becomes restricted. Optional push stores browser subscriptions and sends generic community activity notifications through the browser vendor. Retention is controlled by the site administrator. Optional encrypted composer copies are stored on your device, separately from site drafts; the plugin does not store a passphrase or key, or send them to this site. Recovery expires after 24 hours, requires a current online permission check and sends decrypted text to this site for sanitization and possible normal draft autosave. Remove device copies in the composer or browser storage; site export, erasure and uninstall cannot remotely delete them. Composer previews do not publish or contact an AI provider."
msgstr ""

